		(property "Note" "Default output LOW (F): ENABLE, SCLK, MOSI -> board; reverse channel D = FAULT_N board -> FPGA (spare, pulled up by R86). With J3 unplugged or the FPGA unpowered ISO_ENABLE is LOW within 0.3 us (PhotoMOS open) and FAULT_N to the FPGA reads LOW = asserted when the board is off. Sourcing checked 2026-11-07 [LCSC API / DigiKey CA web]: LCSC C485810 (675 pcs, $1.77); DigiKey CA 0 pcs, backorder to 2027-04 - LCSC / JLCPCB only"
