		(property "Note" "Same part as J3. Board-side copy of J3 (pins 3-15 = ISO_SCLK, ISO_MOSI, ISO_MISO, ISO_CS_DAC, ISO_CS_ADC, ISO_ENABLE, ISO_CS_ADC2; even pins = board GND; pin 1 NC, never the FPGA 3.3 V). To bypass the isolators: close JP7 (side-2 outputs Hi-Z), move the ribbon from J3 to J5. GND_FPGA is then tied to GND through the cable: no isolation."
			(at 248.92 73.66 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
