	)
	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE L1:\nIsolation barrier under the two isolators: no copper on any layer across the gap except the isolator bodies; GND_FPGA pour under J3 and side 1 only. Spacing per IEC 60664-1 for the working voltage set by the +/-100 V electrode side (hv-insulation rule in STIM_Rev1.kicad_dru); the DW body gives 8 mm creepage. C100-C103 at the VCC pins, via at the pad."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
